Package: sdmxlite
Title: Lightweight Client for 'SDMX' Web Services
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Martin", "Cole", email = "martin.cole.dev@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Access 'SDMX' (Statistical Data and Metadata eXchange,
    <https://sdmx.org>) 2.1 and 3.0 REST web services in pure R code.
    Dataflows, data structures, codelists and observations are returned as
    plain data frames, and observations can be converted to 'zoo' or 'xts'
    series.
    A registry of public providers (central banks, statistical offices and
    international organizations) is included. HTTP requests go through
    'libcurl', so proxy settings from the environment and authenticated
    proxies (basic, 'NTLM', 'Negotiate') are supported.
License: GPL-2
URL: https://github.com/marty-cole-dev/sdmxlite
BugReports: https://github.com/marty-cole-dev/sdmxlite/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    xml2,
    zoo
Suggests:
    getPass,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    xts
